{"id":"ec26938b8400741b926e1b4e741f866e464dc01168b5125faa20ed0ca148bd54","pubkey":"16d114303d8203115918ca34a220e925c022c09168175a5ace5e9f3b61640947","created_at":1782856579,"content":"I want DAMAGE to succeed for one simple reason:\nhttps://blossom.yakihonne.com/fe0b571e3947a5f23026d35fa8ff4d7d6740dd61fa14d49535b6c461b0eb6de2.jpeg\na sovereign home.\n\nA home where the machines serve the people inside it — not the cloud, not the subscription layer, not the surveillance stack, not some forced software update pushed by a company that forgot what ownership means.\n\nThe washing machine should wash clothes.\nThe door lock should open the door.\nThe lights should turn on.\nThe node should verify.\nThe software should obey the owner.\n\nThat is the line.\n\nDAMAGE is not just about testing software. It is about restoring accountability to systems that increasingly enter our homes, our wallets, our work, and our lives without asking permission.\n\nBehavior must be verified.\nDependencies must be exposed.\nFailure must be recorded.\nOwnership must return to the edge.\n\nA sovereign home starts with sovereign software.\n\n#DamageBDD #DAMAGE #SovereignHome #Bitcoin #SelfCustody #DecentralizedInfrastructure #OpenSource #HomeAutomation #SoftwareTesting #DigitalSovereignty","tags":[["alt","A short note: I want DAMAGE to succeed for one simple reason:\nht..."],["t","DamageBDD"],["t","damagebdd"],["t","DAMAGE"],["t","damage"],["t","SovereignHome"],["t","sovereignhome"],["t","Bitcoin"],["t","bitcoin"],["t","SelfCustody"],["t","selfcustody"],["t","DecentralizedInfrastructure"],["t","decentralizedinfrastructure"],["t","OpenSource"],["t","opensource"],["t","HomeAutomation"],["t","homeautomation"],["t","SoftwareTesting"],["t","softwaretesting"],["t","DigitalSovereignty"],["t","digitalsovereignty"],["r","https://blossom.yakihonne.com/fe0b571e3947a5f23026d35fa8ff4d7d6740dd61fa14d49535b6c461b0eb6de2.jpeg"],["imeta","url https://blossom.yakihonne.com/fe0b571e3947a5f23026d35fa8ff4d7d6740dd6