{"id":"338a997cf3be4404f1b4ca2d37027b770577f7732da987ee92ca3dbd3c44a485","pubkey":"bc02e0a6c0f01ad9cb57a2b0f8ef8241bc5ff979ce4452ce9e243de457756725","created_at":1782854959,"content":"Today as I was arranging my bouquet my friend called. She had been trying to call me all week.\n\nShe had something urgent to tell me: that groundhogs symbolize opening fully into the dream state, exploring altered states of consciousness fully and deeply, and going into the great unconscious without harm.\n\nNow I feel kind of sorry that the trapper got the little fellow. But Princess was scared to go pee so it had to be done. Also I'm sorry if you're looking for cutlery at any local thrift store. I'm on a mission ➿🥄🔮🥄➿ \n#spoonbending #psychic #philosophy\n\n https://v.nostr.build/NRrNicnSn6wPLoN7.mp4","tags":[["alt","A short note: Today as I was arranging my bouquet my friend call..."],["t","spoonbending"],["t","psychic"],["t","philosophy"],["r","https://v.nostr.build/NRrNicnSn6wPLoN7.mp4"],["imeta","url https://v.nostr.build/NRrNicnSn6wPLoN7.mp4","x 1dea55172399b9464cd507bbc27a743f4b55fb050bfe1ad1d4bbe3a0d80d87d0","size 8517970","m video/mp4","dim 720x1280","blurhash ]GGun0Dj_4o#xvEL%MIAMxn$$$M{D%xuay-;of%MbcWVo}t7n$V@WBRjs;ogj]WBM{RPWBaeofozRjogogozoeofWBRjoL","ox 1dea55172399b9464cd507bbc27a743f4b55fb050bfe1ad1d4bbe3a0d80d87d0","alt "]]}
