{"id":"63639a118a615fded40b224384ebc151dd8adc1514b08944c2f971a30d3517a2","pubkey":"df478568479de26b4a83c1bdc4dbab61b5cc82e1a312e2b28bc815a12a951e67","created_at":1782847660,"content":"Vibe coded a simple HTML website that uses mempool-dot-space to create timestamps to make signing my NIP-23 posts easier.\n\nhttps://timestamper.cloudflareblog.workers.dev/\n\n\nhttps://blossom.primal.net/d16dc8afdb712995734eb1bc9f844b2905e064e6ab73ff502a77e036bd9d64f9.jpg","tags":[["alt","A short note: Vibe coded a simple HTML website that uses mempool..."],["r","https://blossom.primal.net/d16dc8afdb712995734eb1bc9f844b2905e064e6ab73ff502a77e036bd9d64f9.jpg"],["r","https://timestamper.cloudflareblog.workers.dev/"],["imeta","url https://blossom.primal.net/d16dc8afdb712995734eb1bc9f844b2905e064e6ab73ff502a77e036bd9d64f9.jpg","x d16dc8afdb712995734eb1bc9f844b2905e064e6ab73ff502a77e036bd9d64f9","size 98083","m image/jpeg","dim 1011x1910","blurhash ]46tI0oz9tM{I:;hNGSMt7R+L1s:nOV@aK2@n%wdsor?ACoLs:jFsT:+WpXSbHX8{|bbNaR*S#MJR*xuozkC5+s:i_aexG","ox d16dc8afdb712995734eb1bc9f844b2905e064e6ab73ff502a77e036bd9d64f9"],["client","Amethyst"]]}
