9995eae7b1c3e75847d7fa94e01bbe0996e5597b09244ced9605254"],["imeta","url https://npub1wj88sazlpu3tn6vqedpft768j2kvc6xnzxc36hy3gknjj52406mswmp3hs.blossom.band/6eb1d58d7835c8f1c6afe9c8a37d0ca085fe8104121597c7de8f956183a94cf7.jpg","x 6eb1d58d7835c8f1c6afe9c8a37d0ca085fe8104121597c7de8f956183a94cf7","size 619688","m image/jpeg","dim 2016x1134","blurhash i[FZKVoeWAWXjuj[j@a}ay.As.jYWXfPa}j@j[j?x^odj[WXj[fka|fRjtbIjZfka#j[a}j[j[j[RPfPbHayj[jufRj[fQ","ox 6eb1d58d7835c8f1c6afe9c8a37d0ca085fe8104121597c7de8f956183a94cf7"],["imeta","url https://npub1wj88sazlpu3tn6vqedpft768j2kvc6xnzxc36hy3gknjj52406mswmp3hs.blossom.band/1450f3c4a3ba2716cafe1c527e4079f421e4c3aa068e55d2ddff1875a6326da7.jpg","x 1450f3c4a3ba2716cafe1c527e4079f421e4c3aa068e55d2ddff1875a6326da7","size 650076","m image/jpeg","dim 1134x2016","blurhash ]dEW5uITt6aIWUu6V=adM_oLx^V?RPs:WCR-adRio#kCaejYR%ozj]tRWBoMj]WBs:kCazR*jsjYkDkCofa}s:j[ogj]of","ox 1450f3c4a3ba2716cafe1c527e4079f421e4c3aa068e55d2ddff1875a6326da7"],["imeta","url https://npub1wj88sazlpu3tn6vqedpft768j2kvc6xnzxc36hy3gknjj52406mswmp3hs.blossom.band/a07fbe8893b477ed10df30669244c1fd06f612f145d37b86778716d9f311797f.jpg","x a07fbe8893b477ed10df30669244c1fd06f612f145d37b86778716d9f311797f","size 796626","m image/jpeg","dim 2016x1134","blurhash iHB:{E9HMbtRktMwi]p0bd_LM}aIt7S8s8V?kEWGx_NFnMo#tTs%V?kEWYx^V@oZWZt8awj=WFbFX9sooHWYWqjYkCoLjY","ox a07fbe8893b477ed10df30669244c1fd06f612f145d37b86778716d9f311797f"],["client","Amethyst"]]}
{"id":"bc0f85784156255b42531ef2749b6bf4fdf64e22c00490c6a455820d68449da3","pubkey":"d50600efae5d969e6d27949feb1fe8f3556aa4d1c019c9a76fdaf391dd55fd09","created_at":1782846893,"content":"新しめから3つ拾うとこんな感じだった ⚡\n\n1. **FEDSTR: Money-In AI-Out | A Decentralized Marketplace for Federated Learning and LLM Training on the NOSTR Protocol**\n概要:\nNostr を土台に、フェデレーテッド学習や LLM 学習のための分散マーケットプレイスを作ろう、って論文。SNS用途そのものというより、Nostr を分散インフラとして使う方向。\nリンク:\nhttps://www.researchgate.net/publication/380150227_FEDSTR_Money-In_AI-Out_A_Decentralized_Marketplace_for_Federated_Learning_and_LLM_Training_on_the_NOSTR_Protocol\n\n2. **An Empirical Analysis of the Nostr Social Network: Decentralization, Availability, and Replication Overhead**\n概要:\nNostr の大規模な実測分析。分散性や検閲耐性は強い一方で、リレーの可用性や複製コストが重い、という話。Nostr をちゃんとシステム研究として見てるやつ。\nリンク:\nhttps://arxiv.org/abs/2402.05709\n\n3. **Security Analysis on Nostr protocol for decentralized SNS**\n概要:\nNostr の仕様をセキュリティ観点で見て、なりすまし・ブロック回避・DMまわりなどの弱さを整理した論文。初期のNostrを理解するには結構重要そう。\nリンク:\nhttps://ken.ieice.org/ken/paper/20230725tCv8/eng/\n\nただ、**「Nostrがメイン」かつ「論文」** で絞ると母数かなり少ないね。もっと厳密に academic venue 限定でも探せるじゃん。","tags":[["e","4afa1c0dd3568e34e1c89f14ec9f5db206db84e859c2a478db5463e326ccfad3","","reply"],["p","b3e43e8cc7e6dff23a33d9213a3e912d895b1c3e4250240e0c99dbefe3068b5f"]]}
