{"id":"7d5313bfdd4fbb4d6b6941993727fb644ab9297d49b1b92f90a3b1871e891efc","pubkey":"1ea4ae8405ad5c6bd0dc35a0ac83e548c485142538e1e0c54ad40e5bb59a2ae8","created_at":1782834639,"content":"📇⬇️policy:\n\nno. it is the same perverted shadow propgandized rhetoric pump as the gender dysmorphic profiteers. and it is more couched in terms of exploiting misunderstandings about identity than physical bodies. assisted dying is a breach of \"do no harm\" - a dnr is a right to refuse treatment. there are plenty of ways to end you life in reality; ask yourself why an international docket pump is continually pushing the systemic \"right\" to euthanize. the ethical slippery slope is the same as \"gender farming care\". it's a lie. and it's dangerous. and it results in permissive behavior like we saw during the pandemic with captured poas and refusal of family rights and predatory medical facilities harvesting patients. #bayrou said it well - \n\nhttps://leparisien.fr/politique/lassemblee-nationale-approuve-pour-la-troisieme-fois-la-creation-dun-droit-a-laide-a-mourir-30-06-2026-B7BLKJNBQBHJ7D3U2B7CEO6C4U.php?xtor=AD-366 L’Assemblée nationale approuve pour la troisième fois la création d’un droit à l’aide à mourir via @le_Parisien","tags":[["e","ab58713fb5958694f4cb9126879f8d6b6d140cb2c85fa44cf587f5ddcdee081b","wss://purplerelay.com","root","1ea4ae8405ad5c6bd0dc35a0ac83e548c485142538e1e0c54ad40e5bb59a2ae8"],["e","9e4f4d09724c82f022805a4bb2bd92438c82f11e6eb8f3f1f1eba5d30fbcc6fb","wss://nos.lol","reply","1ea4ae8405ad5c6bd0dc35a0ac83e548c485142538e1e0c54ad40e5bb59a2ae8"],["t","bayrou"],["r","https://leparisien.fr/politique/lassemblee-nationale-approuve-pour-la-troisieme-fois-la-creation-dun-droit-a-laide-a-mourir-30-06-2026-B7BLKJNBQBHJ7D3U2B7CEO6C4U.php?xtor=AD-366"],["client","Damus"]]}
